# Vinyl Catalog API - local dev requests
#
# Run these directly from your editor:
#   - VS Code: install the "REST Client" extension, then click "Send Request"
#   - JetBrains IDEs: built-in HTTP Client, click the green arrow
#
# Start the API first: pnpm dev
# After creating a product/variant, set @productId / @variantId below to their ids.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3333
@productId = 1
@variantId = 1

### =========================  Products  =========================

### Create a product
# Body: title (required, 1-255), artist (required, 1-255), releaseYear (optional, 1900-2100)
# -> 201 with the created product
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Thriller",
  "artist": "Michael Jackson",
  "releaseYear": 1982
}

### List products (paginated)
# Query: page (default 1), perPage (default 20, max 100)
# -> 200 with an array
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?page=1&perPage=20

### Get a product by id
# -> 200 with the product, or 404 if it does not exist
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}

### Validation error example
# Empty title -> 422 with validation messages
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "artist": "X"
}

### =========================  Variants  =========================

### Create a variant for a product
# Body: sku (required, unique, 1-64), format (LP|EP|SINGLE|CD|CASSETTE),
#       priceCents (required, integer >= 0), currency (3 letters, e.g. EUR),
#       color/stock/status optional (status: draft|available|sold_out, default draft)
# -> 201 with the created variant; 409 if the sku already exists; 404 if the product is missing
POST {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}/variants
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "MJ-THRILLER-LP-RED",
  "format": "LP",
  "color": "Red",
  "priceCents": 2999,
  "currency": "EUR",
  "stock": 10,
  "status": "available"
}

### List variants of a product
# -> 200 with an array, or 404 if the product does not exist
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}/variants

### Adjust stock (transactional)
# Body: delta (integer) - negative for a sale, positive for a restock
# -> 200 with the updated variant
#    422 if it would make the stock negative (oversell)
#    404 if the variant does not exist
# Side effect: status -> sold_out at 0, -> available above 0 (a draft variant stays draft)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/variants/{{variantId}}/stock
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "delta": -1
}

### Oversell example
# A delta larger than the current stock -> 422
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/variants/{{variantId}}/stock
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "delta": -99999
}
